### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:8080/employees

### Create a valid employee
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lina",
  "salary": 2500
}

### Create with missing name
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "salary": 2500
}

### Broken JSON
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Omar",
}  